{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "6316dc684edbce727821e586afd4e9720ae519c595c933c6f4465a79e950dfc7", "ja": "幸せを纏う場所", "zh": "身披幸福的场所", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7c8f0e16adc5e62faddd09c763a9851870d14b4016142f506da0c1953a2f397f", "ja": "グラビア撮影の衣装選びのため、サロンを\n訪れるアイドル達。煌びやかなドレスに目を\n輝かせ、どれを試着しようかとはしゃぐ。\nプロデューサーも花婿役として、アイドル達\nの試着に付き合う事になる。", "zh": "为了挑选写真拍摄的服装，偶像们来到沙龙。她们看着华丽的礼服，眼睛闪闪发亮，兴奋地讨论着要试穿哪一件。制作人也将作为新郎角色，陪同偶像们试穿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f1ae6840f7292c521eac8ae6b151115cebbe91f75174330ce4964f21aeb6c1f0", "ja": "（来週に控えたグラビア撮影に向け、今日は\nみんなにウェディングドレスを選んでもらおう！）", "zh": "（为了下周的写真拍摄，今天就让大家挑选婚纱吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "848bbc527f4c1bfc35b1a18c5d3b4f7d80938506644f7c75d64ca64dd445fc34", "ja": "わあ～……♪", "zh": "哇～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
