{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "848bbc527f4c1bfc35b1a18c5d3b4f7d80938506644f7c75d64ca64dd445fc34", "ja": "わあ～……♪", "zh": "哇～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "848bbc527f4c1bfc35b1a18c5d3b4f7d80938506644f7c75d64ca64dd445fc34", "ja": "わあ～……♪", "zh": "哇～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "b54c7df7839a7c546b2e47b1372a101e660d2641ab0a1a77693604201f0ea8f3", "ja": "すっ、すっごいキラキラしたお店だぞー！\nなんか、目がチカチカするかも……！", "zh": "这、这家店也太闪闪发光了吧——！\n感觉眼睛都要被晃花了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "31a1531223fbe5b26bb825b1ac7f24f6f59f378f81e8a9eb67987faa5331ee12", "ja": "は～……ウェディングドレスが\nこんなに集まってるところがあるんやな……。", "zh": "哈～……原来有这么多婚纱聚集在一起的地方啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "091b8af4f010185776f8d78fbc869066bf2322dd351e7ed91b5708f2fc6c18aa", "ja": "ここって多分、いや絶対！\n世界で一番女子力が高い場所だよね！？", "zh": "这里大概，不，绝对是全世界最有女子力的地方吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "129d145951dcea498d56c12e582a7f0660074dddfb8c0d94bba9fcbb648fb9f8", "ja": "あれもこれも素敵なものばかりで、目移り\nしてしまいそうです。……意志を強く持て、瑞希。", "zh": "每一件都那么漂亮，看得人眼花\n缭乱。……瑞希，你要坚定意志。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "5c50a53951fe2200228a97c86cb9110f01b121ad174748c3f66f5f64655d27b3", "ja": "試着をしてもいいそうですよ～。\n時間の許す限り、みんなで試しましょう～♪", "zh": "听说可以试穿哦～。\n在时间允许的范围内，大家一起试试吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "c96c00084e5d80a645f83a7d8fce4e29d848a4d228c0d0f677dbbc7202538e7a", "ja": "そして全員、{$P$}さんから\n素敵な感想をもらいましょうね～。むふふ。", "zh": "然后大家都要从{$P$}先生那里得到精彩的感想哦～。呜呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cb3e246a27806e56099bbfd570b91915661f6bc24ce122866028bbd48aaf0354", "ja": "全員……。", "zh": "全员……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "47f06664129be590d83e4a9b30675e35f8da9cb7101f1299d642a4f28a375793", "ja": "（ここで、テンションをわずかにでも下げる発言は\n一切許されない。結構、大変かも……）", "zh": "（在这里，绝不允许有任何哪怕稍微降低气氛的话。看来还挺不容易的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b1ae5059ebb620200819ed84117f407290e7d55b234882190a9b43a194ab8e1a", "ja": "？　どうしたんだ、奈緒。\nなんだかぼーっとして。", "zh": "？怎么了，奈绪？看起来有些发呆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "e4397bbe568b5833820946e6dac8e90565e66e99b02772b7ff828062b1621902", "ja": "その……この間話したやないですか？　結婚って\n不安もたくさんあるけど、きっとそれだけやないって。", "zh": "那个……我之前不是说过吗？结婚这件事虽然有很多不安，但肯定也不只是这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "2a5d5fb4949667009b92a6d11a0aa57a17882272cd5a920eb289fcbe19381100", "ja": "今までも、いろんな想像膨らましてきましたし。\nでも、こうやってウェディングドレスを前にしたら……", "zh": "之前也一直想象过各种各样的事情。\n\n不过，像这样站在婚纱面前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "a7d2cfba8d92abaed286706279fbb72e0d0d4d1467433816daf9539c31944728", "ja": "なんや、不安やったこととか忘れてまうぐらい、\nメッチャ幸せな気分になるんやなって……えへへ♪", "zh": "没想到会幸福到连之前的不安都忘得一干二净呢……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0f0f5641b5a2a98d9e4b84365490c9f035c9544c5dd73e11b69f38462d665cec", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nそういう気分を存分に味わうのも、大事な事だな。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n尽情享受那种心情，也是很重要的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "51d91dc749ae8b2a0af30fdabdef11b5180823c522e613bca36f04124d56a050", "ja": "時間はまだたっぷりあるから、\nゆっくり好きなものを選んでくれ！", "zh": "时间还多得是，\n慢慢挑你喜欢的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "7068841dd73581c5d35ac18f23253ce69566059610b8265fb7cd4d2c12910937", "ja": "はい！　お言葉に甘えて、\n今日はとことん付き合ってもらいますからね！", "zh": "好！那我就不客气了，今天可要好好陪我逛个够哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "f79aa227c61a7b2a91d420af28cebbf588e8f01ea6fa7c8eb05b9676a4e39691", "ja": "マーメイドって名前のドレスもあるんだね！\nこれなんて爽やかな青で、本当に人魚みたいだぞ……。", "zh": "原来还有名字叫“美人鱼”的裙子啊！\n这条是清爽的蓝色，真的很像美人鱼呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "9d07c737ca1685d8353593f1be04d606b65f0cffedaf3facda04dbc8b69a7398", "ja": "おー、大人っぽい感じやな。\n響によう似合いそう！", "zh": "哦，很有成熟的感觉嘛。\n感觉很适合响！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "cf52e2fc50adddf725b756b947b37c319578b06dd50682d709fc8ca71e9b5387", "ja": "そ、そう？　奈緒だったら……\nあのイエローなんて、似合いそうだよね！", "zh": "是、是吗？要是奈绪的话……\n那个黄色，感觉很适合你呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "05c61f21d7b0d2bc3173cbe109438e2f2b13fa83d06392d4c63245966a8b54cf", "ja": "おお、めっちゃ明るい色でええな！\n一味ちゃう感じするわ。", "zh": "哦，好明亮的颜色，看起来真不错！\n感觉很不一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "aa3049675245b59f5dc10a6a5d401c2522b1a8e68d6dab58f5ac03e3b4f88a9c", "ja": "ねえねえ！　試着終わったら、\n記念にみんなで写真撮ろうね！", "zh": "喂喂！试穿完之后，大家一起拍张纪念照吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "db4ed601b1c586d23cc84fa74ffbd6b63c6870d0516634d0c9652327adf8281a", "ja": "素晴らしいアイディアですな～。\n瑞希さんも……瑞希さん？　どうかしたんですか～？", "zh": "真是个绝妙的主意呢～。瑞希小姐也……瑞希小姐？你这是怎么了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "fb9cb679f2d1bd604c031a8522cd40c367da3fb558abcbe2d8cb11e4531fcad3", "ja": "宮尾さん、メニューを見てください。\nここでは新郎用の衣装も貸し出してるみたいです。", "zh": "宫尾小姐，请看一下菜单。\n这里好像也提供新郎礼服的租借。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "999e390c71891b5b53f289c534624433a69143d00c57aeae1e7fe0994045537f", "ja": "正装の{$P$}に隣に立ってもらって、\n撮影ができるのでは。……神オプション。", "zh": "让身着正装的{$P$}站在身边，就可以拍照了吧。……神级选项。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "11396a9a5eefe07829ff5b2adc67924d762292bb3011b78e9b2d2d0d9d5461cd", "ja": "なんと～。それはまさしく、\n予行練習にぴったりですな～。", "zh": "哎呀～那可真是太适合用来预演了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "20b8b367549e4d3545812dfe7594b6d3265d2c90688cf0bf046d8fd6eca949dd", "ja": "ということで、{$P$}さん。\nお洋服のサイズはいくつですか～？", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}先生。\n您的衣服是什么尺码呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "7bbae45a4661f5b97ea198c426e3555662a6977c8fba85d77ecf75657b3f0fee", "ja": "え、俺も着替えるの……？", "zh": "诶，我也要换衣服吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_06_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "bd60504a4161bbb5abafbd865991427532b8806d141a75fbf927d5ea9921f083", "ja": "いいじゃんいいじゃん！\n花婿の代理だって、こなしてもらわなくちゃ！", "zh": "有什么关系嘛！\n你可得好好胜任新郎替身这个角色才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
